%N A399845 Irregular triangle read by rows: T(n,k) = A306646(n,k) mod n (n >= 2, 1 <= k <= floor(n/2)).
%H A399845 Seiichi Manyama, <a href="/A399845/b399845.txt">Rows n = 2..200, flattened</a>
%F A399845 T(n,k) = (n*Sum_{j=1..floor(n/k)} binomial(j,n-k*j)/j) mod n.
%F A399845 If p is prime and k >= 2, T(p,k) = 0.
%e A399845 Irregular triangle begins:
